title Vinyl 0.8.0 (480x320, 320x480 at their real density): the Add form refuses before the prompt (no share name; a user without a password) and says what the helper answered (denied: a share that needs a login, the ZimaOS reason); User name and password adds the two fields (the password masked)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library
env VINYL_DEMO_SHARES 1
env VINYL_DEMO_SHARE_REPLY "err denied wrong share name, or it needs a login"
keyboards 1
wait 1200
key m
wait 500
tap "Library"
wait 700
tap "Music folders"
wait 900
key down
key down
key down
key down
wait 200
key enter
wait 500
type 192.168.68.142
tap "Check and add"
wait 300
shot 01-no-share
expect text "Type the share name."
type music
tap "Check and add"
wait 1300
shot 02-denied
expect text "Check the share name, or sign in with a user."
@480x320,800x480,480x480 tap "User name and password"
@320x480 tap "User and password"
wait 300
shot 03-user-fields
expect text "USER NAME"
tap "Check and add"
wait 300
shot 04-no-user
expect text "Type the user name, or choose Guest."
type reader
key enter
wait 300
shot 05-password-field
expect text "PASSWORD"
tap "Check and add"
wait 300
shot 06-no-password
expect text "Type the password."
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 400
expect text "Add a network folder"
expect noquit
